    "seoDescription": "Search Idealista property listings by location and collect prices, size, rooms, photos, and links. Track housing supply and compare inventory by area.",
    "intro": "Search Idealista by location, operation, and property type. Collect listing IDs, prices, sizes, rooms, locations, coordinates, photo totals, and links across pages.",
    "useCases": [
      "Property investors can compare listing prices, areas, and room counts by location.",
      "Housing analysts can track supply across Idealista markets.",
      "Real-estate teams can collect listing links and photos for property shortlists."
